CS5491: Sample-Efficient FunSearch via Behavioral Fingerprinting for Online Bin Packing

This local academic project extends https://github.com/RayZhhh/funsearch
at commit 4b8b4e7d43287998500983d709dfa44be58fca91.
That implementation is derived from DeepMind FunSearch (2023).
Copied upstream files preserve Copyright 2023 DeepMind Technologies Limited
and their Apache License, Version 2.0 headers.

The original license is retained at phase1b/reference/LICENSE and copied to
the repository root. Existing Phase 1 changes are documented in
phase1b/reference_changes.patch. Phase 2 and Phase 3 additions and their
limitations are documented in the corresponding reports.

OR/Weibull instance literals are retained from the audited upstream snapshot.
OR-Library attribution/provenance limitations and the missing original Weibull
generator seed are disclosed in the dataset manifest and research reports.
No additional dataset ownership/license claim is made here.


